Package: chFnirs
Title: Helper Functions for Second-Level (Group-Level) Analysis of Functional Near-Infrared Spectroscopy (fNIRS) Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Dale J.", "Cohen",
           email = "cohend@uncw.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3353-3340"))
Description: Helper functions for second-level (group-level) analysis of
    functional near-infrared spectroscopy (fNIRS) data. Provides unified
    wrappers for area-wise linear and mixed-model omnibus tests,
    'emmeans'-based activation tests and post-hoc contrasts, slope-based
    continuous-moderator analyses, Benjamini-Hochberg FDR correction, and
    p-value / effect-size / beta heatmap generation. Designed to operate
    on long-format tables of per-subject, per-channel (or per-region)
    response estimates produced by any fNIRS first-level pipeline.
